**Objective:** know which model to reach for on tabular data, and why.

**Watch:** Ridge Regression · Lasso Regression · Decision and Classification Trees · Random Forests Part 1 · Gradient Boost Part 1 and Part 3 (classification).

**Read:**

- Ch 6: 6.2 in full (ridge, lasso, choosing lambda).
- Ch 8: 8.1 in full (trees) and 8.2.1–8.2.3 (bagging, random forests, boosting).

**Skip or skim:**

